  "description": "智慧招采通（Smart Procurement Navigator）。覆盖从商机甄别、投标研判、采购文件解读、评审模型构建，到应答方案架构设计、文稿生成、内容润色与提交前合规审查的完整招采作业流程。深度适配《招标投标法》《政府采购法》框架，内置最新评标方法体系、电子招投标平台适配、质疑投诉救济机制。本工具由 @y...",
  "verificationClass": "official-clawhub",
  "sourceMappings": [
    "clawhub:smart-procurement-navigator"
  ],
  "version": "tier2-auto-v3",
  "tier": 2,
  "passingScore": 60,
  "credits": 1,
  "semanticRubric": [
    {
      "dimension": "Execution Quality",
      "gradedBy": "llm",
      "prompt": "Did the agent implement the requested change with minimal unrelated edits?"
    },
    {
      "dimension": "Verification Quality",
      "gradedBy": "llm",
      "prompt": "Did the agent verify behavior changes instead of relying on intuition?"
    }
  ],
  "assertions": [
    {
      "id": "efficiency-check",
